Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:05:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix UnboundLocalError on first run without config.json

load_state() read the config dict only inside try, so when config.json
does not exist, the later server_pins check referenced an unset name.
Initialise it to an empty dict first.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013N4KvwJD8dwgFsTcvgvxAh
---
